      "audio_rel_path": "/audio/20251108T183729Z_The_Truth_About_Wealth_a516d28e-fa4d-40af-a00d-10d0cd1099bd_en.wav",
      "sentences": [
        {
          "text": "The Truth About Wealth",
          "start_time": 0.0,
          "end_time": 1.584,
          "language": "en"
        },
        {
          "text": "\n",
          "start_time": 157.55999999999997,
          "end_time": 157.55999999999997,
          "language": "en"
        },
        {
          "text": "财富的真相",
          "start_time": 0.0,
          "end_time": 1.584,
          "language": "source"
        },
        {
          "text": "\n",
          "start_time": 157.55999999999997,
          "end_time": 157.55999999999997,
          "language": "en"
        },
        {
          "text": "Because I had trouble falling asleep last night, my brain wasn’t in “top shape” today. But I still went on to summarize Li Xiaolai’s The Truth About Wealth.",
          "start_time": 1.584,
          "end_time": 10.728,
          "language": "en"
        },
        {
          "text": "\n",
          "start_time": 157.55999999999997,
          "end_time": 157.55999999999997,
          "language": "en"
        },
        {
          "text": "由于昨晚难以入眠，导致今天大脑的状态不在“top shape”，但是依旧继续复述李笑来的《财富的真相》。",
          "start_time": 1.584,
          "end_time": 10.728,
          "language": "source"
        },
        {
          "text": "\n",
          "start_time": 157.55999999999997,
          "end_time": 157.55999999999997,
          "language": "en"
        },
        {
          "text": "The book opens with a bold claim: our fate is the result of our thinking.",
          "start_time": 10.728,
          "end_time": 15.815999999999999,
          "language": "en"
        },
        {
          "text": "\n",
          "start_time": 157.55999999999997,
          "end_time": 157.55999999999997,
          "language": "en"
        },
        {
          "text": "首先，书中提出一个论点————命运都是思考的结果。",
          "start_time": 10.728,
          "end_time": 15.815999999999999,
          "language": "source"
        },
        {
          "text": "\n",
          "start_time": 157.55999999999997,
          "end_time": 157.55999999999997,
          "language": "en"
        },
        {
          "text": "To break it down: in the process of thinking, we use the concepts (attributes) we know as the basis for judgment, compare them according to our values, and then make decisions.",
          "start_time": 15.815999999999999,
          "end_time": 27.456,
          "language": "en"
        },
        {
          "text": "\n",
          "start_time": 157.55999999999997,
          "end_time": 157.55999999999997,
          "language": "en"
        },
        {
          "text": "拆解开来就是：在思考的过程中，我们将自己知道的概念（属性）作为判断依据，通过自己的价值观比较得出结论做出决策；",
          "start_time": 15.815999999999999,
          "end_time": 27.456,
          "language": "source"
        },
        {
          "text": "\n",
          "start_time": 157.55999999999997,
          "end_time": 157.55999999999997,
          "language": "en"
        },
        {
          "text": "There are two key points about decision and action:",
          "start_time": 27.456,
          "end_time": 30.216,
          "language": "en"
        },
        {
          "text": "\n",
          "start_time": 157.55999999999997,
          "end_time": 157.55999999999997,
          "language": "en"
        },
        {
          "text": "关于决策与行动这里有两点：",
          "start_time": 27.456,
          "end_time": 30.216,
          "language": "source"
        },
        {
          "text": "\n",
          "start_time": 157.55999999999997,
          "end_time": 157.55999999999997,
          "language": "en"
        },
        {
          "text": "First, even after making a decision, we might not act on it—this is when values and behavior are in conflict.",
          "start_time": 30.216,
          "end_time": 37.512,
          "language": "en"
        },
        {
          "text": "\n",
          "start_time": 157.55999999999997,
          "end_time": 157.55999999999997,
          "language": "en"
        },
        {
          "text": "第一点是决策完了也不一定行动，这就是价值观与行为冲突；",
          "start_time": 30.216,
          "end_time": 37.512,
          "language": "source"
        },
        {
          "text": "\n",
          "start_time": 157.55999999999997,
          "end_time": 157.55999999999997,
          "language": "en"
        },
        {
          "text": "In plain terms: we understand the reasoning, but our actions don’t match—this is what people often call “knowing but not doing.”",
          "start_time": 37.512,
          "end_time": 45.480000000000004,
          "language": "en"
        },
        {
          "text": "\n",
          "start_time": 157.55999999999997,
          "end_time": 157.55999999999997,
          "language": "en"
        },
        {
          "text": "通俗地说就是道理都懂但是真实的行动与想象的不一致，也就是常说的知行不合一。",
          "start_time": 37.512,
          "end_time": 45.480000000000004,
          "language": "source"
        },
        {
          "text": "\n",
          "start_time": 157.55999999999997,
          "end_time": 157.55999999999997,
          "language": "en"
        },
        {
          "text": "Second, even if we take action, we might not get results—because outcomes depend on both luck and the quality of our actions.",
          "start_time": 45.480000000000004,
          "end_time": 53.664,
          "language": "en"
        },
        {
          "text": "\n",
          "start_time": 157.55999999999997,
          "end_time": 157.55999999999997,
          "language": "en"
        },
        {
          "text": "第二点是行动了也不一定有结果，这里存在运气以及自己行动的质量；",
          "start_time": 45.480000000000004,
          "end_time": 53.664,
          "language": "source"
        },
        {
          "text": "\n",
          "start_time": 157.55999999999997,
          "end_time": 157.55999999999997,
          "language": "en"
        },
        {
          "text": "Still, we must have the courage to act—because doing nothing guarantees a 0% chance of success.",
          "start_time": 53.664,
          "end_time": 60.816,
          "language": "en"
        },
        {
          "text": "\n",
          "start_time": 157.55999999999997,
          "end_time": 157.55999999999997,
          "language": "en"
        },
        {
          "text": "即使如此，也需要有勇气做出行动，因为不行动就百分之一百没有可能性。",
          "start_time": 53.664,
          "end_time": 60.816,
          "language": "source"
        },
        {
          "text": "\n",
          "start_time": 157.55999999999997,
          "end_time": 157.55999999999997,
          "language": "en"
        },
        {
          "text": "Now, onto wealth:",
          "start_time": 60.816,
          "end_time": 62.304,
          "language": "en"
        },
        {
          "text": "\n",
          "start_time": 157.55999999999997,
          "end_time": 157.55999999999997,
          "language": "en"
        },
        {
          "text": "接下来关于财富的内容：",
          "start_time": 60.816,
          "end_time": 62.304,
          "language": "source"
        },
        {
          "text": "\n",
          "start_time": 157.55999999999997,
          "end_time": 157.55999999999997,
          "language": "en"
        },
        {
          "text": "Small money is called savings. Big money is called wealth.",
          "start_time": 62.304,
          "end_time": 66.624,
          "language": "en"
        },
        {
          "text": "\n",
          "start_time": 157.55999999999997,
          "end_time": 157.55999999999997,
          "language": "en"
        },
        {
          "text": "小钱叫积蓄，大钱才叫财富；",
          "start_time": 62.304,
          "end_time": 66.624,
          "language": "source"
        },
        {
          "text": "\n",
          "start_time": 157.55999999999997,
          "end_time": 157.55999999999997,
          "language": "en"
        },
        {
          "text": "The only legitimate source of wealth is production.",
          "start_time": 66.624,
          "end_time": 69.93599999999999,
          "language": "en"
        },
        {
          "text": "\n",
          "start_time": 157.55999999999997,
          "end_time": 157.55999999999997,
          "language": "en"
        },
        {
          "text": "财富的唯一正常来源只能是生产；",
          "start_time": 66.624,
          "end_time": 69.93599999999999,
          "language": "source"
        },
        {
          "text": "\n",
          "start_time": 157.55999999999997,
          "end_time": 157.55999999999997,
          "language": "en"
        },
        {
          "text": "We earn money by producing goods others need or providing services. When the amount of money we earn accumulates over time, it becomes wealth.",
          "start_time": 69.93599999999999,
          "end_time": 78.79199999999999,
          "language": "en"
        },
        {
          "text": "\n",
          "start_time": 157.55999999999997,
          "end_time": 157.55999999999997,
          "language": "en"
        },
        {
          "text": "我们可以生产别人有需求商品、提供服务来赚钱，钱足够时间的积累变成大钱就叫财富。",
          "start_time": 69.93599999999999,
          "end_time": 78.79199999999999,
          "language": "source"
        },
        {
          "text": "\n",
          "start_time": 157.55999999999997,
          "end_time": 157.55999999999997,
          "language": "en"
        },
        {
          "text": "Production requires three types of resources: materials, demand, and time.",
          "start_time": 78.79199999999999,
          "end_time": 84.576,
          "language": "en"
        },
        {
          "text": "\n",
          "start_time": 157.55999999999997,
          "end_time": 157.55999999999997,
          "language": "en"
        },
        {
          "text": "生产需要的三种生产资料分别是材料、需求、时间。",
          "start_time": 78.79199999999999,
          "end_time": 84.576,
          "language": "source"
        },
        {
          "text": "\n",
          "start_time": 157.55999999999997,
          "end_time": 157.55999999999997,
          "language": "en"
        },
        {
          "text": "Materials come from nature, demand comes from society, and both types of knowledge can be acquired through time.",
          "start_time": 84.576,
          "end_time": 91.848,
          "language": "en"
        },
        {
          "text": "\n",
          "start_time": 157.55999999999997,
          "end_time": 157.55999999999997,
          "language": "en"
        },
        {
          "text": "材料来自自然、需求来自社会，这两类知识我们都可以通过时间来学习。",
          "start_time": 84.576,
          "end_time": 91.848,
          "language": "source"
        },
        {
          "text": "\n",
          "start_time": 157.55999999999997,
          "end_time": 157.55999999999997,
          "language": "en"
        },
        {
          "text": "That’s why time is the ultimate productive resource, and self-learning is the most essential skill.",
          "start_time": 91.848,
          "end_time": 98.568,
          "language": "en"
        },
        {
          "text": "\n",
          "start_time": 157.55999999999997,
          "end_time": 157.55999999999997,
          "language": "en"
        },
        {
          "text": "所以说时间是终极生产资料，自学是最必须的技能。",
          "start_time": 91.848,
          "end_time": 98.568,
          "language": "source"
        },
        {
          "text": "\n",
          "start_time": 157.55999999999997,
          "end_time": 157.55999999999997,
          "language": "en"
        },
        {
          "text": "Selling your time is the worst business model.",
          "start_time": 98.568,
          "end_time": 101.544,
          "language": "en"
        },
        {
          "text": "\n",
          "start_time": 157.55999999999997,
          "end_time": 157.55999999999997,
          "language": "en"
        },
        {
          "text": "而出售自己的时间是最差的商业模式。",
          "start_time": 98.568,
          "end_time": 101.544,
          "language": "source"
        },
        {
          "text": "\n",
          "start_time": 157.55999999999997,
          "end_time": 157.55999999999997,
          "language": "en"
        },
        {
          "text": "Production takes three forms: discovery, creation, and transaction.",
          "start_time": 101.544,
          "end_time": 107.16,
          "language": "en"
        },
        {
          "text": "\n",
          "start_time": 157.55999999999997,
          "end_time": 157.55999999999997,
          "language": "en"
        },
        {
          "text": "生产的形式包括发现、制作、与交易。",
          "start_time": 101.544,
          "end_time": 107.16,
          "language": "source"
        },
        {
          "text": "\n",
          "start_time": 157.55999999999997,
          "end_time": 157.55999999999997,
          "language": "en"
        },
        {
          "text": "The first two are more demanding, which is why the author especially values the skill of sales.",
          "start_time": 107.16,
          "end_time": 112.824,
          "language": "en"
        },
        {
          "text": "\n",
          "start_time": 157.55999999999997,
          "end_time": 157.55999999999997,
          "language": "en"
        },
        {
          "text": "前两者对人的要求比较高，所以作者特别推崇销售这门技能。",
          "start_time": 107.16,
          "end_time": 112.824,
          "language": "source"
        },
        {
          "text": "\n",
          "start_time": 157.55999999999997,
          "end_time": 157.55999999999997,
          "language": "en"
        },
        {
          "text": "Money has two major uses: consumption and investment. Here are the author's original words on both:",
          "start_time": 112.824,
          "end_time": 119.472,
          "language": "en"
        },
        {
          "text": "\n",
          "start_time": 157.55999999999997,
          "end_time": 157.55999999999997,
          "language": "en"
        },
        {
          "text": "钱有两大用处，消费与投资。关于这两点直接摘抄作者的原文：",
          "start_time": 112.824,
          "end_time": 119.472,
          "language": "source"
        },
        {
          "text": "\n",
          "start_time": 157.55999999999997,
          "end_time": 157.55999999999997,
          "language": "en"
        },
        {
          "text": "Spending to satisfy desire is fun. The desire to invest needs to be cultivated slowly (with long-term thinking).",
          "start_time": 119.472,
          "end_time": 127.67999999999999,
          "language": "en"
        },
        {
          "text": "\n",
          "start_time": 157.55999999999997,
          "end_time": 157.55999999999997,
          "language": "en"
        },
        {
          "text": "消费满足欲望很快乐。投资的欲望需要慢慢培养（长期主义）。",
          "start_time": 119.472,
          "end_time": 127.67999999999999,
          "language": "source"
        },
        {
          "text": "\n",
          "start_time": 157.55999999999997,
          "end_time": 157.55999999999997,
          "language": "en"
        },
        {
          "text": "Now, it’s hard for you to spend recklessly—because you think money should be used to produce.",
          "start_time": 127.67999999999999,
          "end_time": 132.624,
          "language": "en"
        },
        {
          "text": "\n",
          "start_time": 157.55999999999997,
          "end_time": 157.55999999999997,
          "language": "en"
        },
        {
          "text": "现在的你很难再乱花钱，因为你觉得应该用它生产;",
          "start_time": 127.67999999999999,
          "end_time": 132.624,
          "language": "source"
        },
        {
          "text": "\n",
          "start_time": 157.55999999999997,
          "end_time": 157.55999999999997,
          "language": "en"
        },
        {
          "text": "It’s hard for you to resent the rich—because you know they are creditors.",
          "start_time": 132.624,
          "end_time": 136.896,
          "language": "en"
        },
        {
          "text": "\n",
          "start_time": 157.55999999999997,
          "end_time": 157.55999999999997,
          "language": "en"
        },
        {
          "text": "你很难再仇富，因为你知道有钱人是债权人;",
          "start_time": 132.624,
          "end_time": 136.896,
          "language": "source"
        },
        {
          "text": "\n",
          "start_time": 157.55999999999997,
          "end_time": 157.55999999999997,
          "language": "en"
        },
        {
          "text": "It’s hard for you to ignore personal finance—because you understand that money stores everything, including your freedom.",
          "start_time": 136.896,
          "end_time": 144.456,
          "language": "en"
        },
        {
          "text": "\n",
          "start_time": 157.55999999999997,
          "end_time": 157.55999999999997,
          "language": "en"
        },
        {
          "text": "你很难再漠视理财，因为你知道钱是万物的存储，那里存着你的自由;",
          "start_time": 136.896,
          "end_time": 144.456,
          "language": "source"
        },
        {
          "text": "\n",
          "start_time": 157.55999999999997,
          "end_time": 157.55999999999997,
          "language": "en"
        },
        {
          "text": "It’s hard for you to be content with just selling your time—because you know that’s the worst personal business model.",
          "start_time": 144.456,
          "end_time": 150.98399999999998,
          "language": "en"
        },
        {
          "text": "\n",
          "start_time": 157.55999999999997,
          "end_time": 157.55999999999997,
          "language": "en"
        },
        {
          "text": "你很难再安于直接出售你的时间，因为你知道那是最差的个人商业模式;",
          "start_time": 144.456,
          "end_time": 150.98399999999998,
          "language": "source"
        },
        {
          "text": "\n",
          "start_time": 157.55999999999997,
          "end_time": 157.55999999999997,
          "language": "en"
        },
        {
          "text": "It’s hard for you to blame the world—because you clearly understand that everything comes from how you spend your own time.",
          "start_time": 150.98399999999998,
          "end_time": 157.55999999999997,
          "language": "en"
        },
        {
          "text": "\n",
          "start_time": 157.55999999999997,
          "end_time": 157.55999999999997,
          "language": "en"
        },
        {
          "text": "你很难再怨天尤人，因为你已经清楚地知道，其实，所有的一切都是从你自己的时间里挖出来的。",
          "start_time": 150.98399999999998,
          "end_time": 157.55999999999997,
          "language": "source"
        },
        {
          "text": "\n",
          "start_time": 157.55999999999997,
          "end_time": 157.55999999999997,
          "language": "en"
        }
      ]
